50567936,\"iPhone11,6\":150567936,\"iPhone15,2\":138624000,\"iPhone8,4\":137894912,\"iPhone8,1\":137894912,\"iPhone11,4\":150567936,\"iPhone8,2\":162171904,\"iPad14,4-B\":121367552,\"iPhone15,5\":138624000,\"iPhone11,8\":132652032,\"iPhone15,4\":138624000,\"iPhone15,3\":138624000,\"iPad14,4-A\":121367552,\"iPad5,4\":137894912,\"iPad5,3\":137894912,\"iPad13,10\":121787392,\"iPad5,2\":137894912,\"iPad5,1\":137894912,\"iPad6,11\":137894912,\"iPad6,12\":137894912,\"MacFamily20,1\":121787392,\"iPad12,1\":121236480,\"iPad12,2\":121236480,\"iPhone10,3\":162589696,\"iPhone10,2\":162589696,\"iPhone10,1\":138120192,\"iPhone14,3\":138624000,\"iPhone10,6\":162589696,\"iPhone14,2\":138624000,\"iPhone7,2\":137894912,\"iPhone10,5\":162589696,\"iPhone10,4\":138120192,\"iPhone7,1\":162171904,\"iPad13,19\":121236480,\"iPhone14,7\":138624000,\"iPad14,5-A\":121367552,\"iPhone14,6\":121363456,\"iPad14,5-B\":121367552,\"iPhone14,5\":138624000,\"iPad13,11\":121787392,\"iPhone14,4\":138624000,\"iPad13,17\":121367552,\"iPad13,18\":121236480,\"universal\":315948032,\"iPod9,1\":123872256,\"iPhone14,8\":138624000,\"iPad13,16\":121367552,\"iPad6,7\":137894912,\"iPad6,4\":138120192,\"iPad6,3\":138120192,\"iPad6,8\":137894912,\"iPad13,8\":121787392,\"iPad13,9\":121787392,\"iPad13,4\":121787392,\"iPad13,5\":121787392,\"iPad13,6\":121787392,\"iPad13,7\":121787392,\"iPad13,1\":121787392,\"iPad13,2\":121787392}},\"relationships\":{\"app-events\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/app-events?l=en-US\",\"data\":[]},\"reviews\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/reviews?l=en-US\",\"next\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/reviews?l=en-US\u0026offset=10\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"5750138391\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-02T09:36:34Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":14552798,\"body\":\"Hello dear! We are happy to be with you in Yalla. Yalla is an original application that allows you to meet new friends from around the Arab world. We hope that your next comment will also be five stars. If you have suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live.\",\"modified\":\"2020-04-09T01:42:46Z\"},\"review\":\"I’ve been using this app for a good amount of time , my experience has been superb so far👌👌. After joining in yalla,  everyone welcomed me like a family and I became one of them eventually. Here, I’ve been talking to different people, making friends, playing games , earning gifts and doing many other lucrative  activities. This app has made my online time worthwhile. ❤️❤️\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"A big shout-out to yalla\",\"userName\":\"Frenkie'10\"}},{\"id\":\"4284196784\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-08T15:22:46Z\",\"review\":\"If you asked questions nobody would answer, they would just say random things over and over again. The viewers would just do nothing. If I asked if they were real there would be not 1 comment. If there was a comment it wasn’t even related to what I was talking about. I don’t recommend getting this app.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Jomara Blenkharn\",\"title\":\"Unprofessional\"}},{\"id\":\"5749915856\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-02T08:32:32Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":14646972,\"body\":\"Hi, most users (more than 99%) enjoy Yalla for free and they love to have fun with many friends together. Let us work together to develop Yalla to be the best Arab community for our brothers and sisters. If you have any suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live and we hope to see your distinguished comment with the five stars. Thank you!\",\"modified\":\"2020-04-14T05:29:30Z\"},\"review\":\"I’m using this app since last couple of months and I just forgot other apps for time pass. honestly I found a lot of good friends here and in party time I feel like I’m in a party house. just awesome. strongly recommending for all.... 😍😍\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"crowwwn\",\"title\":\"yalla is my favourite app since last few months..\"}},{\"id\":\"4290748067\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T18:21:14Z\",\"review\":\"I enjoy moco several times daily. The poker rooms have live interaction with other players and I even got a date ... occasional glitches that seem to be worked out whenever noticed ... but overall worth it. It's a complex of various social games and media .. mostly uncensored I believe ...\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Levertis Tregunnah\",\"title\":\"Love the app! but suggestions\"}},{\"id\":\"4286221241\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T01:35:33Z\",\"review\":\"So I got this app 2 years ago and I registered my phone number In. I now have TikTok and I can’t add my number in because it’s in here. (I’m guessing the two apps are related somehow) and I’ve tried to delete my number and log out of this app but it never works. Don’t get this app if you are planning on getting TikTok\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Great App!!\",\"userName\":\"Kennieth Kemish\"}},{\"id\":\"4286422607\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T02:26:12Z\",\"review\":\"This app is really cool!!! You can go live and watch people. I did have one problem though 😞 So it sent me something saying I got banned for inappropriate stuff but I NEVER DID ANYTHING!! I just wanted to go live because I was so bored. I am really mad this happened and I was hoping you could reach out to me. Thank you\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Blancha Quakley\",\"title\":\"Issues\"}},{\"id\":\"4275811272\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-07T04:18:40Z\",\"review\":\"Takes forever to deactivate the account! The only option to to it is to contact the customer service. Takes a while. Very disappointed. Creating an account is easy, getting rid of it is a headache. So think twice\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Quick\u0026easy photo collge maker\",\"userName\":\"Joed Kimmings\"}},{\"id\":\"4290769701\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T18:26:34Z\",\"review\":\"The app need a feature where tho you can refresh the page because the chat messages don’t always come through when you get them\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Awesome random video chat\",\"userName\":\"Trenda Caddie\"}},{\"id\":\"6107935027\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-06-22T11:33:15Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":16154760,\"body\":\"Dear users:Please check whether your device allows Yalla to run. If the above problem still exists, please send relevant screenshots to feedback, thank you!\",\"modified\":\"2020-06-23T01:32:49Z\"},\"review\":\"I'm using this app since 3years on my ipad mini but from last week yalla is not working on my ipad I reinstalled the app and also reset my ipad but still doesn't work. When i open yalla suddenly it's shutdown and after that when i open yalla it is ask me to login again. Everything is working perfectly fine on my iPad rather than yalla. And also on my other phone yalla is working perfectly fine. Please solve my problem. Thank you\",\"rating\":1,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Not working on ipad mini\",\"userName\":\"Farwai009\"}},{\"id\":\"5817411675\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-16T00:31:21Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":14626098,\"body\":\"Dear user, we apologize for what happened to you, we will verify and deal with what you said, Yalla is committed to establishing a standardized and fair customer service team, thank you for your love for yalla, we will do our best Create a beautiful environment for you ~\",\"modified\":\"2020-04-13T09:11:56Z\"},\"review\":\"Yalla is really awkward application i am sending emails from 10 days that i have one issue in hindi region but hindi region owner Lost Atlantis and CS Arif Sarkar bangali they disturb whole hindi regoin but no one take action against both of them i am using this application since 156.\\nPlease don't install this app yalla technology say 99% users are saying about application but they are telling a lie with public.\\nResolve my issue then give your comment of this post on playstore\",\"rating\":1,\"isEdited\":true,\"title\":\"complantlaint against lost atlantis and arif sarkar\",\"userName\":\"55873785\"}}]},\"top-in-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/top-in-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"1100991711\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1100991711?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=990\u0026salableAdamId=1100991711\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.pro.oneDA\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.99\",\"price\":0.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.oneDA\",\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"100 Golds\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purchase this item, you will get 100 Yalla Golds.\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/100-golds/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1100998137\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1100998137?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=8990\u0026salableAdamId=1100998137\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.pro.twoDA\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$8.99\",\"price\":8.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.twoDA\",\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"1000 Golds\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purc