"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"9+\",\"value\":200,\"rank\":2,\"advisories\":[\"Infrequent/Mild Mature/Suggestive Themes\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":false,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/yalla-parchis/id1542713951\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.6,\"ratingCount\":1468,\"ratingCountList\":[108,23,41,77,1219],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.6 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0.0.4\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Board\",\"name\":\"Yalla Parchis\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC\",\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 11.0 or later.\"},\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 11.0 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 11.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Yalla Parchis is a free online multiplayer Parchis game, Parchis is a very popular board game, especially in Spain and Latin America. The rules of the game evolved from Ludo, Parchisi and Parcheesi.\\n\\nFeatures:\\n\\n1. Multiple Parchis rules \u0026 modes - There are four rules: Classic, Spanish, Quick and Magic, and you can choose to play in 1v1, 4 players or in teams(2v2). \\n2. In-game voice chat \u0026 chat room - We offer a high-quality social experience where you can voice chat in real-time during the game and use the chat room function to chat with audio and video, send gifts, play games, and host parties with your friends in the room. Everyone here is friendly.\\n3. Collect diverse skins - Play for free and get a variety of skins of dice, theme, token, etc.\\n4. Various events - Festive events with local characteristics are held regularly.\\n5. Up to 30K free Golds every day.\\n\\nIn America and Spain, Parchisi is played with two dice, four tokens per player, and the first player who moves four tokens to the end wins. In Colombia, the Parchis board game is also called \\\"Parqués\\\".\\nAs one of the most popular Parchis games, we are not only committed to bringing the classic Parchis gameplay from memory to online, but also to innovating while respecting tradition.\\nOn the subway, in the park, at home, at any time and place, you can quickly start an amazing Parchis journey and make new friends in chat rooms, from online to offline. If you are looking for a high-quality casual game to enjoy your leisure time, Yalla Parchis will never disappoint you.\\n\\nEnjoy life, enjoy online Parchis!\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 metal \",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://www.yallaparchis.com/\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.8.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, updates are as follows:\\n1. More rewards have been added for watching ads. For example, you can get bingo Power-Ups, the free chance to undo and accelerate unlocking treasure chests. \\n2. The new game \\\"Guess Numbers\\\" has been added to the Chatroom. Now try it with your friends!\\n3. Optimized game experience and fixed bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-26T15:35:13Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, updates are as follows:\\n1. More rewards have been added for watching ads. For example, you can get bingo Power-Ups, the free chance to undo and accelerate unlocking treasure chests. \\n2. The new game \\\"Guess Numbers\\\" has been added to the Chatroom. Now try it with your friends!\\n3. Optimized game experience and fixed bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-13T02:17:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, updates are as follows:\\r\\n1. Added \\\"Magic\\\" rule in the Parchis VIP room.\\n2. New \\\"Sound Wave Circle\\\" function in the Chatroom. \\n3. Optimized game experience and fixed bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-20T02:10:42Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.6.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Improved User Experience - Enhanced the sign-up rewards for new users. \\r\\n2. Free Benefits - This newly added component allows users to earn additional rewards by viewing advertisements. \\r\\n3. Member Club Rewards - Improved the reward structure for tasks within the Member Club.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-18T12:57:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.6.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Improved User Experience - Enhanced the sign-up rewards for new users. \\r\\n2. Free Benefits - This newly added component allows users to earn additional rewards by viewing advertisements. \\r\\n3. Member Club Rewards - Improved the reward structure for tasks within the Member Club.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-09T02:28:20Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Improved User Experience - Enhanced the sign-up rewards for new users. \\r\\n2. Free Benefits - This newly added component allows users to earn additional rewards by viewing advertisements. \\r\\n3. Member Club Rewards - Improved the reward structure for tasks within the Member Club.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-31\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-31T02:00:14Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Piggy Bank – Play Parchis or Bingo to earn diamonds, which are stored in your Piggy Bank. When it's full, you can open it to collect all the diamonds!\\n2.Fragments Fusion Optimization - You can now use fragments of locked skins to fuse them together!\\n3.Truth or Dare - Join in on the fun with our new in-room gameplay: \\\"Truth or Dare.\\\" Experience it with your friends today!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-30T07:00:59Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.New Game Mode: Experience the excitement of the newly added game mode, Magic - it's more fun and fast-paced!\\n2.Skin Fragment Fusion: Get the chance to receive skin fragments when you use the ‘Fusion’ function!\\n3.New In-Room Feature: Enjoy the newly added Light Show Ranking in the chat rooms.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-08T01:30:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.New Game Mode: Experience the excitement of the newly added game mode, Magic - it's more fun and fast-paced!\\r\\n2.Skin Fragment Fusion: Get the chance to receive skin fragments when you use the ‘Fusion’ function!\\r\\n3.New In-Room Feature: Enjoy the newly added Light Show Ranking in the chat rooms.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-18T14:37:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, updates are as follows:\\r\\n1.VIP3 Privileges: Become a VIP3 member to unlock exclusive benefits such as faster EXP gain, comments with special effects, and much more! \\r\\n2.VIP Room Gameplay: Now you have the option to play a Parchis game in the VIP Room without ‘undo’ or ‘block’.\\r\\n3.Chat Emoticons: You can now choose from a wide range of dynamic emoticons and use them in chat rooms!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-15T01:19:50Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, updates are as follows:\\r\\n1.New skins: Skin store is upgraded, and new skins of Bingo games are available now.\\r\\n2.New VIP room for Bingo games: You can chat with friends while playing.\\r\\n3.New function: You can start a light show in the chat room.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-28T03:24:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, a Parchis game supporting real-time online voice chat. Updates are as follows:\\r\\n1. VIP3 Level- Subscribe to the newly added VIP3 level and enjoy more privileges and benefits!\\r\\n2. New Feature \\\"Gift Gameplay\\\" - Join the excitement with the newly added gifting feature 'heat progress bar' in chatrooms.\\r\\n3. Backpack \u0026 Luxury Vehicles - Use backpacks to store gifts \u0026 items. And use the new luxury vehicles to enter chatrooms with dazzling special effects.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-22T11:30:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bingo Game - Enjoy a different game experience in the fast and exciting brand new game, Bingo! You can switch to the Bingo by [Battle] - [Bingo icon].\\n2. Member Club - Added a new 'Member Club' feature in the Chatrooms. Form a club with your closest friends and team up to reach the top.\\n3. Room Theme - Newly added 'Room Theme' feature in the Chatroom.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-18T22:14:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.8.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Players can now enjoy additional benefits when subscribing to VIP \\r\\n2. Added the badge system and upgraded the new \\\"personal information\\\" interface.\\r\\n3. Chat room has been enhanced with 1-1 private chat, the ability to invite other users to your room, and on-seat emojis.\\r\\n4. Improved game experience and bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-30T23:39:00Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.7.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates are as follows:\\n1.Add the feature of sending props when spectating. You have more ways to interact with each other in the game.\\n2.Add private chat. You can have a 1-on-1 chat now.\\n3.Add music and Fun Center in the chatroom. You can listen to music and play mini-games when chatting.\\n4.Add Room, Giver, Receiver and other ranking systems in the chatroom. You can enjoy yourself by interacting with others in a more active room.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-12T01:25:53Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates are as follows:\\n1.Add the feature of sending props when spectating. You have more ways to interact with each other in the game.\\n2.Add private chat. You can have a 1-on-1 chat now.\\n3.Add music and Fun Center in the chatroom. You can listen to music and play mini-games when chatting.\\n4.Add Room, Giver, Receiver and other ranking systems in the chatroom. You can enjoy yourself by interacting with others in a more active room.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-04T15:53:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, a Parchis game supporting real-time online voice chat. Updates are as follows:\\n1.A brand new game mode - Quick mode is available now! Come to experience the very different new mode.\\n2.Guest players can take part in and have fun in the Chatroom Party now.\\n3.Add Weekly Gift Star and Contribution in 7 Days in Chatroom Party. You can get plentiful diamonds/dazzling titles by getting on the list, come and join us! \\n4.Optimize game experience and fix bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-25T01:24:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, a Parchis game supporting real-time online voice chat. Updates are as follows.\\r\\n1.The new version of YallaParchis is coming with our much-anticipated Chatroom Party! Chatroom Party supports online live voice and video chat, also more surprises are waiting for you. The entrance to Chatroom Party is in Events, come and enjoy it with your friends!\\r\\n2.Optimize game experience and fix more bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-12-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-12-02T14:59:35Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, a Parchis game supporting real-time online voice chat. Updates are as follows.\\r\\n1.Become VIP and enjoy more privileges\\r\\n2.Skin subscription upgrades to VIP 1\\r\\n3.Add VIP Room to fight with your friends in the real high bet game \\r\\n4.Add Rank sharing to share with your friends through more channels\\r\\n5.Optimize game experience and bugs fixed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-10-26T01:09:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, a Parchis game supporting real-time online voice chat. Updates are as follows.\\r\\n1.Add Event Pass to get more free awards.\\r\\n2.Purchase Event Pass to line up in Treasure Chest.\\r\\n3.Users can send interaction props during game.\\r\\n4.Add LIKE to make more friends.\\r\\n5.Add Bio \u0026 Constellation in Basic Information.\\r\\n6.Optimize game experience and bugs fixed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-08-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-08-10T01:05:31Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, a Parchis game supporting real-time online voice chat. Updates are as follows.\\r\\n1.Optimized for versions below iPhone X. \\r\\n2.Bugs fixed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-21T23:15:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to YallaParchis, a Parchis game supporting real-time online voice chat. Updates are as follows.\\n1. Add skin subscription function: subscribe to enjoy beautiful skins immediately.\\n2. Add user guidance to help new users understand the app quickly.\\n3. Add weekly reward in treasure chest. Get extra reward if you achieve the goal.\\n4. Add legend Star list.\\n5. Spectators can send comments in game.\\n6. Bugs fixed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-05-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-05-24T22:35:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Welcome to Yalla Parchis,let’s enjoy voice chat with friends during game. \\r\\nUpdates:\\r\\n1.Add rank system: raise rank level to get more diamonds.\\r\\n2.Add global rank and friend rank.\\r\\n3.Add mail system: support system messages and reward distribution.\\r\\n4.Recharge is available during game.\\r\\n5.Add push notification function. Never miss game invitation from friends again.\\r\\n6.Add more delicate profile frames.\\r\\n7.Bugs fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-03-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-03-22T23:07:56Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.0.4\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2021-02-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-02-02T19:47:37Z\"}],\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"editorialNotes\":{\"tagline\":\"Play and chat with friends\"},\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1542713951\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=860082219\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":282527744}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1542713951\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=860082219\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":282527744}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2021-02-02\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"com.yalla.yallaparchisi\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/7f/4d/29/7f4d2967-2198-4081-70bc-3f22eaf7252e/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-0-0-7-0-0-sRGB-0-0-0-GLES2_U002c0-512MB-85-220-0-0.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"592e81\",\"textColor1\":\"f0f4f4\",\"