{\"genreNames\":[],\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"name\":\"思伟 邹\",\"mediaType\":\"Mobile Software Applications\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/%E6%80%9D%E4%BC%9F-%E9%82%B9/id1242210509\"}}]}},\"meta\":{\"contentVersion\":{\"MZ_INDEXER\":1699346691736,\"RTCI\":1697797348587}}},{\"id\":\"1519557264\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1519557264?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Used to Track You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_USED_TO_TRACK_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be used to track you across apps and websites owned by other companies:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Contact Info\",\"identifier\":\"CONTACT_INFO\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"17+\",\"value\":600,\"rank\":4,\"advisories\":[\"Frequent/Intense Simulated Gambling\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":false,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/hawa-group-voice-chat-rooms/id1519557264\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4,\"ratingCount\":57,\"ratingCountList\":[10,4,1,5,37],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.0 stars\"},\"name\":\"Hawa - Group Voice Chat Rooms\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Entertainment\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"Hawa Technology Limited\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"hawa, come for love, meet by sound\\n\\nHawa offers a social space that focuses on sound, where you can not only get rid of the social pressure in reality, but also quickly meet new friends from various regions in the Middle East. Without social labels, use voice and thought to collide with strange souls to obtain purer friendship or love.\\n\\nIn Hawa, explore new worlds, explore love.\\n\\n【Make new friend】\\nCome to hawa to explore different themed voice rooms, use your voice to show your talent and personality, and meet people who understand you anytime, anywhere!\\n\\nNo need to show your face without social pressure, express yourself as much as you want and talk about topics you are interested in, such as food, sports events, fashion trends, etc. A variety of themes to meet all your preferences!\\n\\n【Fun Game】\\nHost an online party with new friends from all over the Middle East, and a large number of trendy room games will help you quickly break the ice and become the most popular party king!\\n\\n【special gift】\\nHawa, you can get customized gifts, luxury cars and gorgeous headwear. Come and light up your unique gift catalogue!\\n\\n【Ranking】\\nExclusive medals and privileges to show your status and position.\\n\\nMusic\\nListen to your favorite keep up with the world music trends. Share your song list, show your voice live!, this is your exclusive music party.\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.21.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store, and we recommend that you turn on automatic updates in your Settings to ensure a better Hawa experience for the first time\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-02T00:02:07Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.21.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"【 Version 1.21.0 Update Information 】\\n1、The overall optimization of the room, so that you have a more special gift experience;\\n2、Personal homepage UI upgrade, more rich display of your personalization;\\n3、Assets have a new way to display, so that all your treasures on the platform being more valuable；\\n4、Use intelligent throttling technology to reduce your traffic consumption by 50%\\n5、Fix known bugs\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-24T10:50:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.20.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store, and we recommend that you turn on automatic updates in your Settings to ensure a better Hawa experience for the first time\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-21T02:25:48Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.20.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store, and we recommend that you turn on automatic updates in your Settings to ensure a better Hawa experience for the first time\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-12T23:16:31Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.20.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\n\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\n\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-07T16:14:39Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.20.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\n\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\n\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-07T01:12:42Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.20.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\n\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\n\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-01T01:15:45Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.20.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[1.20.0 version update information]\\n1. Add a hundred level temple and personal level rewards, including exquisite upgrade pop-up windows, personal skin, and personal cards, to help you show off your unique self and share your unique self with your friends together;\\n2. Add a list of millions of stars to share your glorious moments with the entire platform;\\n3. Add permission settings:\\n1) Add a single line off microphone function in the room, allowing you to have more permissions and avoid being disturbed in the room;\\n2) Add salary distribution permissions and problem feedback settings for anchors to provide them with more sense of security.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-29T01:39:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.19.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\n\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\n\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-18T17:17:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.19.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\n\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\n\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-17T15:18:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.19.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[1.19.0 version update information]\\n1. Add do not disturb privileges to protect you from being disturbed by strangers;\\n2.Add a colorful SID, in the form of letters + numbers, to customize your exclusive ID;\\n3. The user level has added a hundred-level temple, creating a new world for hundred-level users.\\n\\nThank you for your support and valuable suggestions along the way, we will continue to bring you a better user experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-16T10:16:54Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.18.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here! This update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-02T08:17:00Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.18.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[1.18.0 version update information] \\n1. Add a new guild invitation function, allowing you to more conveniently invite friends to join the guild;\\n2. Add app push function, with friends' private messages, room activities, hot chat rooms, etc., to notify you anytime and anywhere, so you don't miss out on every exciting content ;\\n3. Add room Mailang configuration to make the content of the live broadcast room more colorful.\\nThank you all for your support and valuable suggestions along the way. We will continue to improve our products and bring you a better user experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-31\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-31T02:23:31Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.17.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\n\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\n\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-20T14:18:11Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.17.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.17.5 Version Update Information \\n1. Fix the issue of joining/exiting guild series and improve the efficiency of guild function usage ；\\n2. Optimize the floating screen position of the lucky box, public review full service notifications, and other issues to provide a better experience for the lucky box you send out ；\\n3. Optimize Team Battle turntables, headgear, status, and other issues to give you a better experience in Team Battle ；\\n4. Optimize homepage recommendations to present you with the highest quality content .\\n\\nThank you all for your support and valuable suggestions along the way. We will continue to improve our products and bring you a better user experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-15T00:11:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.17.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\n\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\n\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-27T15:00:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.17.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\n\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\n\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-14T06:44:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.17.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"【Version 1.17.0 update information】\\n1. The super exciting and fun Team Battle (PK in the room) is online\\n2. Optimized account information security, allowing you to have a more secure experience\\n3. Added the function of improving the efficiency of guild use\\n4. Fixed some known bugs and improved performance\\n\\nThank you for your support and valuable suggestions along the way. We will continue to improve our products and bring you a better experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-13T01:58:31Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.16.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\n\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\n\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-03T00:08:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.16.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The latest version of Hawa is here!\\nThis update: Solves some experience issues and provides a smoother room chat experience.\\nIn order to provide a better experience, Hawa will be updated regularly in the App Store. It is recommended to open iPhone [Settings] - [App Store] - [App Update] to ensure a better Hawa experience as soon as possible\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-29T02:57:39Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.16.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[1.16.0 version update information]\\n1. New and upgraded lucky box gameplay\\n2. Optimization of registration and login process\\n3. Performance improvement and optimized user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-22T12:35:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.15.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fix bug.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-06T00:52:13Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.15.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fix bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-03T01:23:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.15.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[1.15.0 New Version Updates]\\n1. Overall optimization of app page for the arrival of Ramadan\\n2. The public screen of the room slide the message bar to reply to the content\\n3. Fixed some known bugs and improved performance\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-20T06:20:37Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.14.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[1.14.0 new version update information]\\n1. Events can be previewed more conveniently in the room\\n2. The overall page optimization of the room public screen makes the room more beautiful\\n3. Fixed some known bugs and improved performance\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-16T00:50:36Z\"}],\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\