You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_USED_TO_TRACK_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be used to track you across apps and websites owned by other companies:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Purchases\",\"identifier\":\"PURCHASES\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"17+\",\"value\":600,\"rank\":4,\"advisories\":[\"Frequent/Intense Mature/Suggestive Themes\",\"Infrequent/Mild Contests\",\"Infrequent/Mild Cartoon or Fantasy Violence\",\"Infrequent/Mild Simulated Gambling\",\"Infrequent/Mild Profanity or Crude Humor\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"chartPositions\":{\"appStore\":{\"position\":153,\"genreName\":\"Entertainment\",\"genre\":6016,\"chart\":\"top-free\",\"chartLink\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/charts/iphone/entertainment-apps/6016\"}},\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":false,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/weplay-%D9%88%D9%8A%D8%A8%D9%84%D8%A7%D9%8A-game-chat/id1589399089\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.4,\"ratingCount\":41091,\"ratingCountList\":[2808,1274,1959,3745,31305],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.4 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.3.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Entertainment\",\"name\":\"WePlay (ويبلاي) -  Game \u0026 Chat\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"WEJOY PTE. LTD.\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 12.0 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 12.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 12.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"WePlay is a Party Game app that young people love to play. It offers the most popular casual party games and voice interaction. You will get more fun when playing this games! \\n\\n[Online Party Game Bar]\\nDraw \u0026 Guess: it not only tests your creativity but also your teamwork and drawing skills!\\nWeParty: The most popular game where civilians and killers pit their wits against one another!\\nMore and more new party games will be released in WePlay!\\n\\n[New Interactive Features]\\nImage \u0026 Cloth Changing: Create the 3D image, face pinching, model clothes, show your self-image!\\nVIP gift: Become the VIP of WePlay and get the unique gifts which includes the special rings and other privilege!          \\nPlay games, sing and do interesting things in WePlay!\\nIn WePlay, there are always humorous and friendly games waiting for you.\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 gamekit \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.9.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-13T02:22:20Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.9.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-11T11:37:45Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.9.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-28T02:30:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.8.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Optimized the bullet screen, which supports sliding and closing\\n2. Optimized the customer service system\\n3. Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-20T09:18:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.7.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- لقد قمنا بتحسين تجربة البرنامج وأصلحنا المشكلات المعروفة لجعل WePlay أكثر متعة.\\nإذا كانت لديك أي أسئلة أو اقتراحات أثناء الاستخدام، فيرجى الانتقال إلى [أنا] - [أسئلة الشائعة] لإخبارنا.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-09T00:31:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.5.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.إصلاح المشكلات التقنية.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-01T23:49:56Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.5.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.New Voice Room Gameplay 'Dragons War' Launched\\n2.Optimized the lucky ID of voice room and color-changing supported\\n3.Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-26T03:34:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.4.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-10T10:55:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.4.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-04T14:00:14Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.4.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Launched the Mic Grab\\n2. Optimized the types of the list in the Voice Room\\n3. Expanded the range of members' worth\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-01T03:26:07Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.3.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-14T02:25:41Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.3.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-10T01:11:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.3.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-02T21:56:20Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.3.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Optimized the matching mechanism of battle games and fixed the problem of matching failure\\n2.Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-01T02:31:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.2.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-31\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-31T13:31:20Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.2.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The YouTube mode is launched in the Voice Room, which supports watching YouTube videos.\\n2. The customer service system has been upgraded, so it can provide the users with better service.\\n3. Added the privilege for VIP users to restore relationships.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-12T11:47:37Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.1.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Updated the icon of Charm.\\n2.Updated the icon of Vip.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-13T11:02:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.1.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Bug fixes and improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-07T09:43:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.1.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Launched the Voice Room Event Center\\n2. Launched a new version of Ludo\\n3. Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-29T10:05:45Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.9.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Launched a new Q\u0026A mode of Who's the Spy.\\n2. Upgraded the full server notification to makes it more gorgeous.\\n3. Optimized network settings to reduce data consumed when you use the app.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-23T03:37:36Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.8.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Fixed known problem of the gift panel\\n2. Optimize the experience of Crazy Camel\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-10T15:59:00Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.8.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Optimized the game experience of Who’s the Spy.\\n2. Added the offline mode of Who’s the Spy.\\n3. Bug fixes and improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023